      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Pássaro Algodão. Swablu cuida constantemente de suas asas semelhantes a algodão e toma banho para se limpar quando fica sujo. Ele não consegue relaxar se seu corpo ou o ambiente ao redor não estiverem limpos, e usa as próprias asas para remover a sujeira.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Dragão, Voador &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Swablu pode evoluir para Altaria no nível 12 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Astonish, Growl, Peck</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Sing</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Fury Attack, Safeguard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Disarming Voice</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Mist</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Round</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Dragon Breath, Natural Gift</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Refresh</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Mirror Move</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Cotton Guard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Dragon Pulse</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Perish Song</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Moonblast</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Aerial Ace, Agility, Attract, Body Slam, Brave Bird, Confide, Dazzling Gleam, Defog, Disarming Voice, Double Team, Dragon Cheer, Dragon Pulse, Dream Eater, Dual Wingbeat, Echoed Voice, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, False Swipe, Feather Dance, Fly, Frustration, Haze, Heal Bell, Heat Wave, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hurricane, Hyper Voice, Ice Beam, Outrage, Play Rough, Power Swap, Protect, Psych Up, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Roost, Round, Safeguard, Sky Attack, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Steel Wing, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Tailwind, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thief, Toxic, Trailblaze, Uproar</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Agility, Astonish, Defog, Dragon Rush, Feather Dance, Haze, Hyper Voice, Play Rough, Power Swap, Pursuit, Rage, Roost, Steel Wing, Tailwind</p>",
